o exhibition at Galerie Xavier Hufkens in Brussels followed by an exhibition at the Tate Gallery, Liverpool (2000). In 2002, a major exhibition of his work was shown at the Kunsthalle Recklinghausen, Germany, and toured to the Musee d'Art Moderne et d'Art Contemporain, Nice\"", "readingModes": {"text": false, "image": false}, "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": false, "contentVersion": "preview-1.0.0", "previewLink": "http://books.google.be/books?id=ED5OYgEACAAJ&dq=intitle:%22Barry+Flanagan%22+inauthor:%22Barry+Flanagan%22&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=15&source=gbs_api", "infoLink": "http://books.google.be/books?id=ED5OYgEACAAJ&dq=intitle:%22Barry+Flanagan%22+inauthor:%22Barry+Flanagan%22&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api", "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/Barry_Flanagan.html?hl=&id=ED5OYgEACAAJ"}, "saleInfo": {"country": "BE"}, "accessInfo": {"country": "BE", "epub": {"isAvailable": false}, "pdf": {"isAvailable": false}, "accessViewStatus": "NONE"}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "Barry Flanagan was born in Prestatyn, North Wales in 1941."}}, {"kind": "books#volume", "id": "zNU6GQAACAAJ", "etag": "gomURImhDRY", "selfLink": "https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes/zNU6GQAACAAJ", "volumeInfo": {"title": "Barry Flanagan", "subtitle": "Sculptures in Bronze 1980-1981", "authors": ["Barry Flanagan"], "publishedDate": "1981", "readingModes": {"text": false, "image": false}, "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": false, "contentVersion": "preview-1.0.0", "previewLink": "http://books.google.be/books?id=zNU6GQAACAAJ&dq=intitle:%22Barry+Flanagan%22+inauthor:%22Barry+Flanagan%22&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=16&source=gbs_api", "infoLink": "http://books.google.be/books?id=zNU6GQAACAAJ&dq=intitle:%22Barry+Flanagan%22+inauthor:%22Barry+Flanagan%22&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api", "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/Barry_Flanagan.html?hl=&id=zNU6GQAACAAJ"}, "saleInfo": {"country": "BE"}, "accessInfo": {"country": "BE",